{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Note that the mitochondrial HSP70 (Yeast SSC1, human HSPA9) PAM complex import motor should be annotated to the new MF term:\n\nGO:0140388 protein translocation chaperone activity\nBinding to the exposed unfolded portion of a polypeptide as it emerges from a membrane translocation channel/pore to drive its unidirectional transport across a membrane. Iterative cycles of ATP-dependent binding/rebinding by the chaperone prevents back sliding and drive vectorial transport. PMID:11733493\n\nIf you make an EXP annotation to this please let me know so that we can get it PAINTED!\n\nCC @marcfeuermann \n\n\n", "created_at": "2026-02-24T13:06:27Z", "key": "comment:3951658355", "type": "comment", "updated_at": "2026-02-24T13:06:27Z"}
